# Supabase — used by the Contact page to record delivery orders through the
# public.place_order() RPC (see src/supabase.js and supabase/migrations/).
#
# The anon key is public by design: it ships to every browser and is gated by
# row level security. NEVER put the service_role key in a VITE_ variable —
# it would ship to every browser too.
#
# Local development: copy this file to .env.local and fill the values printed
# by `supabase status`. Without these variables the site silently keeps its
# WhatsApp-only behaviour.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
